OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss steps down after
OL,4,Asecurity issues in rooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoydell, who stood down on 17 August,
OL,7,Fhas been replaced on an interim basis
OL,8,Fby Ray Reidy. In a statement, Reidy
OL,9,Fsaid: "We remain focused on the safety
OL,10,Fand well-being of our guests and will
OL,11,Fcontinue taking the actions necessary
OL,12,Fto strengthen the business.
